# Fleet targets for scripts/deploy-fleet.sh
#
# One line per Pi: <name> <ssh-host> <remote-app-dir>
# <ssh-host> should be an SSH key–authenticated host — either an entry from
# ~/.ssh/config (recommended, e.g. an alias pointing at the Tailscale IP) or
# a raw user@host/user@tailscale-ip.
#
# Copy this file to fleet.conf (gitignored — it's a private list of your
# devices) and fill in real entries once the other Pis are set up with
# Tailscale + SSH keys.
#
# Example:
# main      pi-main       /home/pi/aniweb
# friend1   pi-friend1    /home/pi/aniweb
# friend2   pi-friend2    /home/pi/aniweb
